Description: Catholic background of the day for GNOME and other GTK desktops
 Application that puts a work of Catholic sacred art, chosen for each day
 by a Catholic background of the day server, as the background of the
 desktop and, optionally, of the lock screen and of the login screen
 (SDDM and LightDM with the GTK or Slick greeter).
 .
 It shows the image of any day with its explanation and keeps the
 background up to date with a systemd user timer. It does not need the
 GNOME Shell extension, nor any KDE library.
